/**
 * Sovereign Icon Primitive (Hardened v4)
 *
 * An elegant wrapper for Lucide and custom SVG icons.
 * Features:
 * - NativeWind v4 class support
 * - Semantic sizing (xs -> xl)
 * - Accessibility defaults (aria-hidden)
 * - Type-safe 'as' prop
